  "reviews": {
    "node-1jcxq0c": {
      "supported": false,
      "issue": "The node claims a point register maps AL-44 to P-R and does not prove every disturbance appears in the sample export. The evidence (IA-P02) confirms the mapping exists but explicitly states it 'does not establish valve state or guarantee all disturbances are logged.' However, the node's proposed status is 'supported' while its verified flag remains false; this creates a contradiction where an unsupported inference about logging completeness is treated as supported without resolving whether AL-44 actually detected the pressure drop at 10:00 AM. The evidence shows P-R dropped from 6.8 to 5.8 bar at 10:00:11, yet no record confirms this triggered an alarm or was logged in a way that proves detection failure versus sampling interval limitations.",
      "evidenceNeeded": "A definitive statement confirming whether the pressure drop at P-R (from 6.8 to 5.8 bar) generated an AL-44 alarm event and why it may not have been captured if logging gaps exist, or evidence establishing that sample export intervals inherently miss transient drops.",
      "question": "Does IA-P02 explicitly state whether the pressure drop at P-R between 10:00:11 and 10:00:40 triggered an AL-44 alarm event, and if not, what evidence establishes that sample export intervals inherently miss transient drops?"
    },
    "node-aoyj0l": {
      "supported": false,
      "issue": "The node claims the work package cover indicates a blank temporary instruction attachment field at issue time but does not prove whether a service-routing change occurred. The evidence (IA-S02) confirms the field is 'Blank at folder issue' and that draft preparation alone doesn't satisfy distribution requirements. However, no passage establishes what actually happened regarding any routing change versus documentation status; thus treating this as supported without resolving whether an unrecorded change existed violates the rule against inferring absence from missing records.",
      "evidenceNeeded": "Evidence establishing whether a service-routing change occurred despite the blank field, or confirmation that no such change was made and why it remains undocumented.",
      "question": "Does any evidence confirm whether a service-routing change actually occurred for WO-527-E before issue time, or is there only an absence of documentation without proof of occurrence?"
    },
    "node-xkjnfv": {
      "supported": true,
