      "question": ""
    }
  },"decision":{"summary":"Two nodes (1jcxq0c and aoyj0l) are unsupported due to gaps in evidence linking observations to causal claims. Node xkjnfv is supported as it directly cites explicit log entries.","evidenceUsed":["IA-S02_work_package_cover.md","IA-P02_point_register.md","IA-I01_original_incident"],"unknowns":["Whether AL-44 alarm triggered by pressure drop at P-R was logged or missed due to sampling intervals; whether a service-routing change occurred despite blank field.","confidenceScore: 0.85,"
